{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:0.4"], "en": "Ajina Thera’s Verse:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:1.1"], "en": "“Even if one is a possessor of the threefold knowledge,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:1.2"], "en": "a conqueror of death, and free from taints;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:1.3"], "en": "The foolish, not understanding him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
