{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:2.1"], "en": "But as for one who [knows] of food and drink...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:2.2"], "en": "Even if a person here is of evil character,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.5:2.3", "PA_thag_2.5:2.4"], "en": "if they are one who gains [the favor of] these [monks], they are honored by them.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
